    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56f519c3499f2f6d9d1da535",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咕……太没出息，了……麦昆同学，\n有着耐力。小钻也有着惊人的加速力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "967af8fd04c607188827b2524b520a2d119f3238acce55a057aa46d76458cdb5",
