    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36cec522e7902546e12562fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我自己的却什么都没找到……！　这样下去，\n想成为在比赛中能给大家带来勇气的马娘，就实在……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aebe3036861986bce236cd2c970f475abf28f4fc9421f4dd1ebd8d48937c4752",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
