    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc2582f6d2579c10bf4cbe9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹",
      "source_fingerprint": "b35c8efe526549443c05f78c85df93324a34a54bd209672f562a6e43ba69f190",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1068/storytimeline_041068002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7314488f93dd0373712772d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爸爸不仅是个受欢迎的人。他能理解别人的痛楚，\n正因如此，才会向各种各样的人伸出援手……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c9575a8910739495062b4f489cfe9257606b757859e04d82e28bab9974f46ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1068/storytimeline_041068002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f773ef720b2b07e7c3386bf3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹",
      "source_fingerprint": "b35c8efe526549443c05f78c85df93324a34a54bd209672f562a6e43ba69f190",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1068/storytimeline_041068002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f661944eac02c82a2a9fe0af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然唱歌和赛跑不同，但我也想变成爸爸那样。\n想成为能够给别人带来勇气和朝气的马娘……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cf7453684a9a6ebb79d541e11cc50c8ac91cd6fbc0b74a2114458153a202583",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1068/storytimeline_041068002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80d93ffc53c4d73c2816a92c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但我觉得你那份侠义之心很了不起",
      "source_fingerprint": "e579b1495b39d82cb19f43301bd2543c23472baa4f87a987346b9a0bb14962b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1068/storytimeline_041068002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b9f76b47db6893f1a15f598",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹",
      "source_fingerprint": "b35c8efe526549443c05f78c85df93324a34a54bd209672f562a6e43ba69f190",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1068/storytimeline_041068002.json",
      "json_path": [
