      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99b8f0b1391320dcaa7c0c20",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么，我来搬吧！　没关系，\n不过20km往返而已！　这点程度没什么的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19cded19fe440caa5aa151f81e82d11898cfa15d1680f026866bde636d6bdc4f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1068/storytimeline_041068002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4a8cc6d72c09c846e655e33",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想起了她前几天迟到时说的话。连续解决了别人的\n好几个麻烦。本人却说『没什么大不了的』……",
      "source_fingerprint": "99f037cccc1318ed26f8e2132c7b1cee2b36b196954c9613a3d4f92d2db62748",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1068/storytimeline_041068002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bd260d5de608f54ad239c75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或者说从那方面，或许能找到什么可能性。\n我决定从别的角度切入这个问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e8f072687720c0e02213083c442cb98b6d28c659567fa2a1ea8c3650f69347a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1068/storytimeline_041068002.json",
      "json_path": [
